✗ A Microsoft account needs its full name

This looks like a Microsoft account e-mail. Windows wants it as
MicrosoftAccount\you@example.com.

1. Type MicrosoftAccount\ before the e-mail, for example
MicrosoftAccount\you@example.com.
2. Use the account password. A PIN or fingerprint does not work here.

